 "description": "Khajanchi2017 - Uniform Persistence and Global Stability for a Brain Tumor and Immune System Interaction\nBioModels BIOMD0000000921 (curated). SBML file: khajanchi2017.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 60 time units (SED-ML: khajanchi2017.sedml), sampling 0.06.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 2.99e-06 of species peak (worst: G)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Elimination_of_glioma_due_to_interaction_with_CTL_and_macrophage term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Elimination_of_glioma_due_to_interaction_with_CTL_and_macrophage term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): M1 = M",
